Partitions in curved toughened glass:
– dependable and strong - curved toughened glass is far more resistant to loads than ordinary glass, since toughening increases its strength more than fivefold;
– safe - on impact, curved toughened glass breaks into small but entirely blunt pieces that cannot injure anyone;
– easy to install – this project took 2 weeks to manufacture and 2 weeks to install;
– they allow a design of any complexity to be created by applying films.
